  4596	   190	## Decision States
  4597	   191
  4598	   192	- `READY`: all blocking ACs have adequate evidence, protected tests are intact, required human items are explicitly accepted, and release controls are ready.
  4599	   193	- `CONDITIONAL`: machine evidence passes, but named non-blocking follow-up or time-bounded production evidence remains. State the exact condition and owner.
  4600	   194	- `NOT READY`: any blocking AC, protected-test integrity check, required human acceptance, rollback control, or environment evidence is missing or failed.
  4601	   195	- `BLOCKED`: the review cannot obtain required credentials, environment, device, approval, or authoritative input. Do not convert lack of evidence into a pass.
